| `decimal` | `isStoredNumeral(v)` | ditto |
| `null` | `v === null` | |
| `literal` | membership in `allowed`, by `base` | binary compared by octets |
| `set` | `v instanceof Set && v.size > 0 && [...v].every(el)` | **non-emptiness is why `identifying` was right about `set`** |
| `array` | `Array.isArray(v) && v.every(el)` | **`[]` is `true`, correctly — F2 dissolves rather than being patched** |
